# Looking up at the mirror from an angle and up close (mirror_look_up.steps and
# mirror_look_moving.steps, straight on, found nothing wrong): turned round to the glass, walked
# most of the way in, then with Y held, strafing and turning either way, shots as it goes
wait_up
wait 1.0
hold left 0.6
wait 0.3
hold left 0.6
wait 0.5
hold up 2.5
wait 0.3
keydown y
wait 0.5
shot ma_00_up
hold l 0.4
shot ma_01_strafed_left
hold l 0.4
shot ma_02
hold r 0.8
shot ma_03_strafed_right
hold r 0.8
shot ma_04
hold left 0.15
shot ma_05_turned_left
hold left 0.15
shot ma_06
hold left 0.15
shot ma_07
hold right 0.6
shot ma_08_turned_right
hold right 0.15
shot ma_09
hold up 0.3
shot ma_10_closer
hold up 0.3
shot ma_11
hold up 0.3
shot ma_12
hold up 0.3
shot ma_13
keyup y
wait 0.4
shot ma_14_level
